Description: Initialize eligible Manual popup backings transparently
 Initialize new eligible ARGB popup backing pixmaps to transparent before
 publication. Preserve stock initialization
 for late redirection and overlapping same-depth Background=None sources.
 Reuse native bit-gravity and CopyWindow handling when resizing.
Author: 胡力文 <151860361+TudouXiang@users.noreply.github.com>
Origin: local
Bug: https://github.com/deepin-community/xorg-server/pull/48
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-12
